{"seq":3,"slug":"ci-accessibility-pipeline","title":"CI 无障碍管线门控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-accessibility-implementation-testing/testing/ci-accessibility-pipeline","wordCount":910,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"ci-无障碍管线门控\">CI 无障碍管线门控</h1><p>将无障碍检查嵌入 CI/CD 管线是「无障碍左移」策略的最后一环——确保每次代码变更都经过自动化无障碍检测，回归问题在合并前被阻断。2026 年的工程实践表明，在 CI 中门控无障碍（accessibility gating）的团队，其生产环境无障碍违规率比仅做季度审计的团队低 70%+。关键不是工具选择，而是门控策略的合理性——过严会阻塞开发流、过松则形同虚设。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>CI 无障碍管线涉及三个层级的检查，从快到慢、从浅到深：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[代码提交] --&gt; B[Pre-commit Hooks]&#10;    B --&gt; C[CI Lint Stage]&#10;    C --&gt; D[CI Test Stage]&#10;    D --&gt; E[CI Audit Stage]&#10;    E --&gt; F[合并/部署]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;eslint jsx-a11y&lt;br/&gt;耗时: &lt;5s&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;Biome/ESLint 全量&lt;br/&gt;耗时: 10-30s&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;jest-axe 组件测试&lt;br/&gt;耗时: 30-60s&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[&quot;@axe-core/playwright E2E&lt;br/&gt;耗时: 2-5min&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[&quot;Lighthouse CI 审计&lt;br/&gt;耗时: 1-3min&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[&quot;结果 diff 报告&lt;br/&gt;新增违规检测&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[代码提交] --&gt; B[Pre-commit Hooks]\n    B --&gt; C[CI Lint Stage]\n    C --&gt; D[CI Test Stage]\n    D --&gt; E[CI Audit Stage]\n    E --&gt; F[合并/部署]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"eslint jsx-a11y&lt;br/&gt;耗时: &lt;5s\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"Biome/ESLint 全量&lt;br/&gt;耗时: 10-30s\"]\n    D --&gt; D1[\"jest-axe 组件测试&lt;br/&gt;耗时: 30-60s\"]\n    D --&gt; D2[\"@axe-core/playwright E2E&lt;br/&gt;耗时: 2-5min\"]\n    E --&gt; E1[\"Lighthouse CI 审计&lt;br/&gt;耗时: 1-3min\"]\n    E --&gt; E2[\"结果 diff 报告&lt;br/&gt;新增违规检测\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>门控级别</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>阻断策略</th>\n<th>容忍度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Pre-commit</td>\n<td>eslint-plugin-jsx-a11y</td>\n<td>error 级别立即阻断</td>\n<td>零容忍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CI Lint</td>\n<td>全量 lint 规则</td>\n<td>error 阻断 PR</td>\n<td>零容忍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CI Component Test</td>\n<td>jest-axe / vitest-axe</td>\n<td>violations.length &gt; 0 失败</td>\n<td>可配置排除已知问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CI E2E</td>\n<td>@axe-core/playwright</td>\n<td>critical + serious 阻断</td>\n<td>moderate/minor 仅警告</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CI Audit</td>\n<td>Lighthouse CI</td>\n<td>分数低于阈值阻断</td>\n<td>阈值可渐进提升</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"github-actions-配置示例\">GitHub Actions 配置示例</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"name: Accessibility CI&#10;on: [pull_request]&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  a11y-lint:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v4&#10;      - run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile&#10;      - run: pnpm lint # 含 jsx-a11y 规则&#10;&#10;  a11y-component-test:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    needs: a11y-lint&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v4&#10;      - run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile&#10;      - run: pnpm test -- --grep &quot;a11y&quot; # 仅运行无障碍相关测试&#10;&#10;  a11y-e2e:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    needs: a11y-lint&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v4&#10;      - run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile&#10;      - run: pnpm exec playwright install --with-deps chromium&#10;      - run: pnpm build&#10;      - run: pnpm exec playwright test tests/a11y/&#10;      - uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4&#10;        if: failure()&#10;        with:&#10;          name: a11y-violations-report&#10;          path: test-results/a11y-report.json\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Accessibility CI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pull_request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  a11y-lint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm/action-setup@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm install --frozen-lockfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><s